                                "sense_id": "fa1e5a43-2123-3313-85d9-17a541bf5fd1",
                                "text": "Het feest bereikte zijn hoogtepunt toen de band begon te spelen.",
                                "translation": "The party reached its climax when the band started to play.",
                                "english": "The party reached its climax when the band started to play."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67d19808-ac61-4624-8695-cff28169203e",
                                "sense_id": "fa1e5a43-2123-3313-85d9-17a541bf5fd1",
                                "text": "Zijn carrière bereikte een hoogtepunt toen hij een internationale prijs won.",
                                "translation": "His career hit a zenith when he won an international award.",
                                "english": "His career hit a zenith when he won an international award."
